# Public property filters (G5)
@base_url = http://localhost:3000

### Location substring, case insensitive
GET {{base_url}}/properties?location=gothenburg

### Inclusive maximum nightly price
GET {{base_url}}/properties?max_price=1200

### Capacity for at least four guests
GET {{base_url}}/properties?guests=4

### All filters together
GET {{base_url}}/properties?location=gothenburg&max_price=1200&guests=4

### No matches: 200 with []
GET {{base_url}}/properties?location=zzzz-no-such-location

### Invalid price: 400
GET {{base_url}}/properties?max_price=-1

### Invalid guest count: 400
GET {{base_url}}/properties?guests=1.5

### G8: ascending price
GET {{base_url}}/properties?sort=asc

### G8: descending price with combined filters
GET {{base_url}}/properties?location=Sweden&max_price=1200&guests=2&sort=desc

### Invalid sort: 400
GET {{base_url}}/properties?sort=invalid
